                            Case
---------------------------------------------------------------------

Syntax: case <target>

Case reports a mark's visible inventory and makes that living your one
Studied target for two minutes. Studying a fresh mark creates two
Opportunity.
Meaningful successful jobs against NPCs award small Thief GXP scaled
by the shared kill tracker. Repeating one target within thirty minutes
pays 100%, 50%, 25%, then no job GXP.

Switching Studied targets normally carries at most two Opportunity.
Ghost mastery can raise that carry limit to three, four, and five.
